                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        | The goal of dog training shouldn't be MORE management. It should be LESS. Think about that. If you're constantly telling your dog: ❌ Don't jump. ❌ Get down. ❌ Leave it. ❌ Stop pulling. ❌ Come here. ❌ Stay out of that. …you're spending your life managing your dog. That's why the H in HOME stands for HABITS. Good habits eventually become the dog's default behavior—the things they do without you constantly having to tell them what to do. And that's when something pretty amazing happens: Structure creates FREEDOM. Freedom to have your dog out when guests come over. Freedom to take them places. Freedom to relax together instead of constantly watching them. Freedom for your dog to simply be part of your life. We don't want dogs waiting for us to manage every decision they make. We want to teach them how to make better decisions on their own. Because the ultimate goal of training isn't a dog you have to control every minute. It's a dog you can LIVE with. ❤️🐾 Habits = More Freedom.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +| 
